DECLARE Applicant HAS
    `years of continuous residence` IS A NUMBER
    `months physically present`     IS A NUMBER
    `months in the district`        IS A NUMBER
    `resided since applying`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `good moral character`          IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN a IS AN Applicant
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be naturalized` a IF
        (a's `years of continuous residence`) AT LEAST 5
    AND (a's `months physically present`) AT LEAST 30
    AND (a's `months in the district`) AT LEAST 3
    AND a's `resided since applying`
    AND a's `good moral character`
